 "notes": [
  "Reference cards are unequal: col1 361 wide, col2 376 wide; row-1 cards 247 tall, rows 2-3 only 233-235 tall. One template (card 1, LEGENDARY geometry, 361x247) is used for all six; instances sit on a uniform 252 px pitch, so the diamond panel and footer are 22 px lower than the reference (content_height 1694, scrolls).",
  "Frames from other cards are stitched to 361x247 without scaling: epic drops a 15 px band inside the painting region (horizontal stitch); rare/uncommon duplicate a plain 12/14-row band of the text column (vertical stitch). Seams lie in covered or plain areas.",
  "Painting region is 192x216 (the smallest inner height across the six cards). Every frame's inner painting region is fully inpainted, so a 12-18 px band of blurred tier haze shows under the painting in the row-1 frames.",
  "Legendary frame keeps its own price pill and BUY baked (they are the template's); epic/rare/uncommon frames have pill+BUY rows erased because their baked ones sit 8-16 px off the template; the template's shop/price_pill and shop/buy parts are drawn for every tier.",
  "Badges MYSTIC, SPECIAL, COMMON are not on this screen: reuse the inventory screen's. All six paintings carry their rarity badge baked in at rel [12,9].",
  "Type icons (sword/armor/horse) are darkkey crops; name, type, tier, price are live text."
 ],
